# DryRun "Explain" tutor — LLM provider config (all optional).
# The client is provider-agnostic (OpenAI-compatible). Defaults target a LOCAL
# Ollama so no key is needed and code never leaves your machine.
#
# Local setup:
#   ollama serve
#   ollama pull qwen2.5-coder:7b        # or qwen2.5-coder:14b if you have the RAM
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and adjust only if you change providers.

EXPLAIN_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
EXPLAIN_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b
EXPLAIN_API_KEY=ollama

# ── Alternative: Groq (hosted open models, fast, free tier) ───────────────────
# EXPLAIN_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# EXPLAIN_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# EXPLAIN_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here

# ── Alternative: Together ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EXPLAIN_BASE_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1
# EXPLAIN_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct
# EXPLAIN_API_KEY=your_together_key_here
